---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
titleSuffix: When Party
ogTitle: When Party blog
description: Notes on the work before the party, from When Party.
permalink: /
---
<section class="intro">
  <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-stroke" aria-hidden="true"></span> Notes from the road to the party</p>
  <h1>Success comes before work<br><em>only in the dictionary.</em></h1>
  <p class="attribution">Mark Twain</p>
  <p class="intro-text">Food for thought while the chairs are still being carried.</p>
</section>

{% set posts = collections.posts | newestFirst %}
{% if posts.length %}
<ul class="posts" aria-label="Posts">
{% for post in posts %}
  <li class="post">
    <a class="post-link" href="{{ post.url }}">
      {% if post.data.cover %}<img src="{{ post | postAsset(post.data.cover) }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{% else %}<span class="post-blank" aria-hidden="true"></span>{% endif %}
      <p class="post-meta">{{ post.date | shortDate }}{% if post.data.audio %} · Audio {{ post.data.audio.minutes }} min{% endif %}</p>
      <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
      <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
      <span class="read">Read</span>
    </a>
  </li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p class="empty">The first post is on its way.</p>
{% endif %}
